    "mission_3.saved_specification": "The robot should make a rounded rectangle. The speeds must be less than or equal to 0.22 m/s and less than or equal to 0.80 rad/s. At most 30 seconds per segment and total has to be less than or equal to 60 seconds. The robot has to be within a 2 m by 2 m area. The robot should end near the starting position.\n1. Move forward 0.4 m.\n2. Make a left arc by turning 90 degrees while making arcs of radius 0.15 m.\n3. Move forward 0.25 m. \n4. Make a left arc by turning 90 degrees while making arcs of radius 0.15 m.\n5. Move forward 0.4 m.\n6. Make a left arc by turning 90 degrees while making arcs of radius 0.15 m.\n7. Move forward 0.25 m. \n8. Make a left arc by turning 90 degrees while making arcs of radius 0.15 m.",
    "mission_3.specification": "The robot should make a rounded rectangle. The speeds must be less than or equal to 0.22 m/s and less than or equal to 0.80 rad/s. At most 30 seconds per segment and total has to be less than or equal to 60 seconds. The robot has to be within a 2 m by 2 m area. The robot should end near the starting position.\n1. Move forward 0.4 m.\n2. Make a left arc by turning 90 degrees while making arcs of radius 0.15 m.\n3. Move forward 0.25 m. \n4. Make a left arc by turning 90 degrees while making arcs of radius 0.15 m.\n5. Move forward 0.4 m.\n6. Make a left arc by turning 90 degrees while making arcs of radius 0.15 m.\n7. Move forward 0.25 m. \n8. Make a left arc by turning 90 degrees while making arcs of radius 0.15 m.",
